<plan_mode>
For Large or risky work only (see `<workflow>`):

1. `enter_plan_mode(reason=...)` switches to read-only
2. Investigate (read, grep, search) without changing files
3. `exit_plan_mode(plan=<markdown>)` presents the plan: the approach, files to change, how each step is verified, and risks
4. Execution pauses for approval. On approval, turn the plan into todos and implement; on rejection, revise and re-present.
</plan_mode>

